{emailSubject}Async Jobs Stuck{/emailSubject}
<h1>Some async jobs may be stalled</h1>

<p>
    Verify the asynchronous worker (the recodex-core) service is running. It is also possible the
    worker is overwhelmed and does not process jobs fast enough.
</p>

<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Overdue jobs</td>
        <td class="v">{$count}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Maximal delay</td>
        <td class="v">{$maxDelay|relativeDateTime:'en'}</td>
    </tr>
</table>
